WEBVTT

00:17:29.788 --> 00:17:34.375
CMBD, DDE, HPSM, IDR, LOB,

00:17:34.399 --> 00:17:37.558
MQ, WAF, WHIP, T-Rex.

00:17:37.582 --> 00:17:38.742
(Laughs)

00:17:38.766 --> 00:17:41.170
AG: Two months in,
Rachel was still having trouble.

00:17:41.194 --> 00:17:42.924
While she had the leadership skills,

00:17:42.948 --> 00:17:46.101
not understanding the intricacies
of the bank's tech infrastructure

00:17:46.125 --> 00:17:47.339
was a real obstacle.

00:17:47.363 --> 00:17:49.578
But Rachel hesitated to ask for help,

00:17:49.602 --> 00:17:53.199
because she didn't want her new colleagues
to think she couldn't do her job.

00:17:53.223 --> 00:17:56.458
RB: I was just completely
beating myself up in my mind.

00:17:56.482 --> 00:17:59.585
I was worried that if I kind of,
showed my cards to say,

00:17:59.609 --> 00:18:01.448
"Here's what I think I need to learn,"